{"2376450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lighthouse Of The Souls (LOTS)", "steam_appid": 2376450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/f1e2e81e18dabd9510125f0941afd04f.avif?t=1771527995\" width=896 height=98 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LIGHTHOUSE OF THE SOULS is a third-person action roguelite with hack and slash and RPG mechanics, set in a dark supernatural fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game features realistic visuals, a strong atmospheric tone, and a soulslike-inspired experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face ever-changing challenges alone or in online co-op with up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/8fe7f6ce7890545b23911e8f4f50efca.avif?t=1771527995\" width=896 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark fantasy island hides a ruined bridge between the world of the living and the underworld.<br> The remains of an ancient civilization lie scattered across the land—one that once worshiped dark guardians and performed rituals to guide lost souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A corrupted Cardinal, driven by grief and obsession, has reopened the gates between realms, unleashing the corruption that now consumes the island.<br> Six heroes, each with unique origins and combat styles, are drawn to this place to purge its corruption and uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The narrative is environmental and atmospheric, revealed through exploration, enemy design, and fragments of lore scattered throughout the world.<br> Emotional connection emerges from surviving the island’s moral decay and confronting the tragedy behind the fall of the antagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/c7f74241077dc828dab0988543ac8453.avif?t=1771527995\" width=896 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from six playable heroes, each with their own background, combat style, and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every character offers a distinct approach to danger, encouraging experimentation and replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Samurai • Swiss Guard • Exorcist • Lakota Warrior • Gaucho • Shaolin Monk •</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/c6bf62ec207959a4a7e8390c4070249a.poster.avif?t=1771527995\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/c6bf62ec207959a4a7e8390c4070249a.webm?t=1771527995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/c6bf62ec207959a4a7e8390c4070249a.mp4?t=1771527995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/51cf0a119bb40cad1964fee984c624ca.avif?t=1771527995\" width=896 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LOTS features four progressive difficulty modes that transform enemy behavior, atmosphere, and the overall sense of danger:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casual:</strong> Designed for first-time players, with minimal pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal:</strong> The world begins to fight back, and a wandering spirit follows your progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard:</strong> Corruption intensifies, and the Cardinal actively hunts you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extreme:</strong> The ultimate trial, with more enemies, active disadvantages, and critical decisions at every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/137451aeccd1539cef6a74f412803e19.poster.avif?t=1771527995\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/137451aeccd1539cef6a74f412803e19.webm?t=1771527995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/137451aeccd1539cef6a74f412803e19.mp4?t=1771527995\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Higher difficulties increase enemy variety, rewards, and achievement unlocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/689bba1f47b1d00ed1cfbc54de4b0b01.avif?t=1771527995\" width=896 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op roguelite for up to 4 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural maps and dynamic missions that reshape the world every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique story-driven missions with minibosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent death.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run feels different and demands constant adaptation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/ed08d647a9fa7b203f9aa27584db6dc9.avif?t=1771527995\" width=896 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During each run, you collect souls, gold, and cards that modify your stats with both benefits and penalties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Between runs, you can unlock permanent upgrades, new heroes, and long-term progression that strengthens future attempts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/d6f3f0f6356bd774f446de373b5c7935.avif?t=1771527995\" width=896 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is fast, direct, and demanding:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time hack and slash combat with an emphasis on reflexes and positioning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradeable weapons with multiple tiers, unlocking increased damage and special effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolving abilities that allow you to adapt your playstyle every run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/192aa33a00cdd3924586cbe756895703.avif?t=1771527995\" width=896 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LIGHTHOUSE OF THE SOULS is an evolving experience in active development.<br> Player feedback is essential to improve balance, expand content, and refine the final experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us, explore the island, and help shape the world we want to build 🕯️</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/f1e2e81e18dabd9510125f0941afd04f.avif?t=1771527995\" width=896 height=98 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LIGHTHOUSE OF THE SOULS is a third-person action roguelite with hack and slash and RPG mechanics, set in a dark supernatural fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game features realistic visuals, a strong atmospheric tone, and a soulslike-inspired experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face ever-changing challenges alone or in online co-op with up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376450/extras/8fe7f6ce7890545b23911e8f4f50efca.avif?t=1771527995\" width=896 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark fantasy island hides a ruined bridge between the world of the living and the underworld.<br> The remains of an ancient civilization lie scattered across the land—one that once worshiped dark guardians and performed rituals to guide lost souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A corrupted Cardinal, driven by grief and obsession, has reopened the gates between realms, unleashing the corruption that now consumes the island.<br> Six heroes, each with unique origins and combat styles, are drawn to this place to purge its corruption and uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The narrative is environmental and atmospheric, revealed through exploration, enemy design, and fragments of lore scattered throughout the world.<br> Emotional connection emerges from surviving the islan